show pocket22_lining atoms
style pocket22_lining stick
color #1/B:385,/B:232,/B:382,/B:393,/B:381,/B:357 magenta
color #1/B:231,/B:388,/B:390,/B:392,/B:387,/B:391,/B:383,/B:229,/B:234,/B:235,/A:180,/B:398 gold
surface pocket22_lining
transparency pocket22_lining 70
color pocket22_lining slate gray
marker #1022 position 37.663,44.245,54.147 color red radius 1.0
2dlabels text "Pocket 22 (47% druggable) *" xpos 0.02 ypos 0.11 color black size 14

# ========== Color Legend ==========
# Magenta = Catalytic residues (GLU, ASP, HIS, SER, CYS, LYS)
# Forest Green = Aromatic residues (PHE, TYR, TRP)
# Gold = Hydrophobic residues (ALA, VAL, LEU, ILE, MET, PRO)
# Slate surface = Pocket cavity
# Red marker = Druggable site centroid
# Gray marker = Non-druggable site centroid

# ========== Usage ==========
# To view pocket: view pocket1_lining
# To hide surface: hide pocket1_lining surface
# To show H-bonds: hbonds pocket1_lining
